 "caption": "Second and third cipher passages of Antonio Pérez's autograph letter to Don John of Austria, 19 August 1578 (RAH, 2/Ms Caja 8 no. 4, images 2–3), decoded here sign by sign with the key K_P2 as transcribed by Brice Dudout.",
